--- !u!114 &2025040012
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2025040010}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#4CD9B2>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> InventoryComponent.AddItemInstance
    / TryCaptureSelection / GetPhysicalSlotRecord \xB7 InventoryTransferService.TransferSelection
    \xB7 InventoryHand.SetSlotIndex / TryGetEquippedSelection / UseEquippedItem \xB7
    InventoryUseAction.TryUse.\n<color=#4CD9B2>\xBB</color>  <b>Scene workflow:</b>
    Select 'Hotbar - nine permanent slots', 'Temporary catch - four slots', 'Podium
    - exact unique instance' and 'Inventory demo - select and use' (InventoryHand,
    InventoryUseAction, InventoryDemoController). Slot rows are InventorySlotGridView
    with manual InventorySlotView cells.\n<color=#4CD9B2>\xBB</color>  <b>Verification:</b>
    Play: Deposit catch, select the PET slot and Use - it moves to the podium with
    the same UID; Recall brings it back. Take damage, select CELL, Use: +25 HP, one
    CELL consumed.\n<color=#4CD9B2>\xBB</color>  Btn_Slot N -> InventoryHand.SetSlotIndex(N-1)
    (NoCode); keys 1-9 do the same\n<color=#4CD9B2>\xBB</color>  InventoryHand.OnUseSelectionRequested
    -> InventoryUseAction.UseSelection -> OnUsed -> InventoryDemoController.OnCellUsed\n<color=#4CD9B2>\xBB</color> 
    Labels: InventoryTotalCountText (Total, Selected) and InventoryItemCountText
    - no code"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
